WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.858
Video 19. e-Invoice ane e-Way Bill. Banne Beta
ma chhe.

00:00:07.058 --> 00:00:13.463
e-invoice e sales invoice chhe jene sarkaar nu
IRP register kare chhe.

00:00:13.393 --> 00:00:22.347
IRP ek IRN ane signed QR code aape chhe. Te
invoice par chhapaay chhe.

00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:25.851
e-way bill rasta parna maal saathe jaay chhe.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:31.839
Hisaab Services ma e-Invoice ane e-Way Bill
saathe Beta line dekhaay chhe.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:39.365
Hisaab e tene partner ni test copy saathe chakaasyu
chhe, haji saachi service saathe nahi.

00:00:40.445 --> 00:00:47.100
Alt+Z thi Exchange khule chhe. Send for
e-Invoicing pehli line chhe.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:55.445
F2 thi period. Hisaab invoices gothve chhe: pending,
corrections needed, ane IRN generated.

00:00:56.146 --> 00:01:01.774
Invoice 2 ma buyer no PIN code nathi. Pehla te
sudhaaro.

00:01:01.804 --> 00:01:10.769
S thi invoices Hisaab Services dwaara online jaay chhe. X
thi portal par bulk upload maate JSON bane chhe.

00:01:11.849 --> 00:01:20.148
e-Invoice report ma darek invoice tena IRN,
Ack No. ane Ack Date saathe dekhaay chhe.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:32.097
Invoice 4 kholo, ane Ctrl+P dabaavo. IRN, Ack
No. ane signed QR code upar chhapaay chhe.

00:01:33.177 --> 00:01:43.764
Alt+Z, W thi Send for e-Way Bill khule chhe. Hisaab pehla shu
sudharvu te bataave chhe: ahiya PIN code ane antar.

00:01:44.615 --> 00:01:50.475
Darek e-way bill ne teno number, teni validity
ane vehicle number male chhe.

00:01:50.955 --> 00:02:00.156
Beta ma, darek IRN ane darek e-way bill portal
par chakaaso. Aagalno video: TDS.

